-control surfaces
-------------
# This allocator uses the ductedfan4 physical control effectiveness model.
# B maps control-surface deflection in radians to angular acceleration:
#   B * u_rad = [roll_accel pitch_accel yaw_accel]^T
#
# Runtime disturbance hook for testing:
#   USER_ADD_DIST / USER_DIST_MAG update allocation limits and add the legacy
#   fixed surface bias [-dist, +dist, +dist, -dist].
#   USER_DIST_MAG is in radians.
# Runtime model hook:
#   USER_OMEGA2F_MC updates both the INDI model and this physical control effectiveness matrix B.
#   The initial B below uses k_omega2force = 1.
# The physical mapping remains fixed:
#   u = -0.3491 -> mixer output -1 -> PWM_MIN
#   u = +0.3491 -> mixer output +1 -> PWM_MAX
#
# Original SimpleMixer settings, preserved without literal mixer tags:
#   OLD_M 2
#   OLD_S 0 0  -10000  -10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_S 0 2   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_M 2
#   OLD_S 0 1  -10000  -10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_S 0 2   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_M 2
#   OLD_S 0 0   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_S 0 2   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_M 2
#   OLD_S 0 1   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#   OLD_S 0 2   10000   10000      0 -10000  10000
#
# Old normalized equivalent, y = [roll pitch yaw]^T and
# u_norm = [surface1 surface2 surface3 surface4]^T
#   u_norm = B_inv_norm * y
#   B_inv_norm =
#     [ -1.0   0.0   1.0
#        0.0  -1.0   1.0
#        1.0   0.0   1.0
#        0.0   1.0   1.0 ]
#   B_norm = pinv(B_inv_norm) =
#     [ -0.5000   0.0000   0.5000   0.0000
#        0.0000  -0.5000   0.0000   0.5000
#        0.2500   0.2500   0.2500   0.2500 ]
#
# C: <y_dim> <u_dim> <b_unit>, b_unit 0 normalized/unitless B, 1 physical/dimensional B.
#    USER_AC_METHOD selects method 0 INV, 1 WLS, 2 DIR, 3 PCA.
#    Only b_unit 1 B/u_feedback is valid for INDI.
# U: <umin> <umax> <local_output_slot> <feedback_slot> <actuator_type>
# actuator_type 0 servo/control surface, 1 motor.
# feedback_slot 0..3 publishes the final physical surface deflection in rad
# to actuator_outputs_value.delta[] for INDI. Use -1 for non-surface actuators.
-------------
